      "SkillDescribe": "<span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Basic Attack</span></span><br><br>Press repeatedly or hold <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> to perform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Mid-air Attack</span></span><br><br>Consume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Dodge Counter</span></span><br><br>Press <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> shortly after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span>. Press <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 4.",
