    {
      "SkillType": "Resonance Skill",
      "SkillName": "Dream Blend",
      "SkillDescribe": "<span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</span></span><br><br>Lily starts with <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</span> by default. When <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</span> is active, press Resonance Skill to switch to <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</span>, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span> to nearby targets.<br>This skill shares a Cooldown with <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</span></span><br><br>When <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</span> is active, press Resonance Skill to switch to <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</span>, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span> to nearby targets.<br>This skill shares a Cooldown with <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</span>.",
