    {
      "SkillType": "Resonance Liberation",
      "SkillName": "Into the Dream Cradle",
      "SkillDescribe": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Slumberland</span> and grants <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=151203>Cradle Lullaby</te></span> to Resonators in the team.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Slumber</span></span><br><br>Lasts for 50s. When Lily is in <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Slumberland</span>, she heals the nearby active Resonator every 3s. During <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Slumberland</span>, use directional input to command <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dreambind</span> to deal <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span> to nearby targets. <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dreambind</span> pulls in targets within a certain range every 5s, and stops attacking 10s after movement stops. Press Resonance Liberation again during <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Slumberland</span> to end it early.<br>When Lily is in <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Slumberland</span>, when a Resonator in the team casts <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Intro Skill</span>, targets within a certain range are pulled in.<br>Switching to another Resonator during <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Slumberland</span> keeps Lily on the field, and she takes no DMG while in <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Slumberland</span>. Lily leaves the field when <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Slumberland</span> ends, or earlier if she gets too far from the active Resonator.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Cradle Lullaby</span></span><br><br>Lasts for 25s. While this effect is active, each <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Intro Skill</span> cast by a Resonator in the team grants 1 stack of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=151204>Dream Aroma</te></span>. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Dream Aroma</span></span><br><br>Each stack increases the ATK of all Resonators in the team by 7%, stacking up to 4 times. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator or when <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Cradle Lullaby</span> ends.",
