      "SkillDescribe": "<span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">First Bloom</span></span><br><br>Attack the target, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span>. Press <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Eternal Bloom</span></span><br><br>After casting <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</span>, Lily's next Intro Skill <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">First Bloom</span> is replaced with <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Eternal Bloom</span>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span>.<br>For every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.<br>Press <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.",
