    {
      "SkillType": "Forte Circuit",
      "SkillName": "Dreamland of Flowers",
      "SkillDescribe": "<span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Dream Perfume</span></span><br><br>Lily can hold up to 300 points.<br><span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Basic Attack</span>, <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Mid-air Attack</span>, and <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dodge Counter</span> restore <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dream Perfume</span> on hit.<br>Casting <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</span> or <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</span> restores <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dream Perfume</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</span></span><br><br>When <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dream Perfume</span> is full, hold <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> to cast <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</span>, consuming all <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dream Perfume</span> to pull in nearby targets, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span>. During the skill, she gains 10% DMG Reduction and continuously deals <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span> to nearby targets. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.<br>Lily continuously gains <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dreambell Chime</span> during the skill. When <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dreambell Chime</span> reaches 300 points, press or hold <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> to stop the skill immediately and cast <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</span>. <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</span> is automatically cast at the end of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</span>. Casting <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</span> consumes all <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dreambell Chime</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</span></span><br><br>Attack targets within range, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span>.<br>For every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.<br>Casting the skill grants Lily <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Sillage</span> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Sillage</span> and grants <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></span> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 25s.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</span></span><br><br>When <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dream Perfume</span> is full, hold <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> to cast <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Woven Woven Phantasm</span>, consuming all <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dream Perfume</span> to pull in nearby targets, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span>. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.<br>Lily continuously gains <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dreambell Chime</span> during the skill. When <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dreambell Chime</span> reaches 300 points, press or hold <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Normal Attack</span> to stop the skill immediately and cast <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</span>. <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</span> is automatically cast at the end of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</span>. Casting <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</span> consumes all <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Dreambell Chime</span>.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</span></span><br><br>Attack targets within range, dealing <span style=\"color:#f8e56cff;\">Spectro DMG</span>.<br>For every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.<br>Casting this skill grants Lily <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Sillage</span> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\">Sillage</span> and grants <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></span> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 25s.<br><size=10></span><br><br><span class=\"font-bold font-whitney text-3xl style=\"color:aliceblue;\">Silvered Dream</span></span><br><br>Lasts for 30s.<br>When the Resonator with this effect is the Active Resonator and can trigger Unison Response, their ATK is increased by 7% for each stack of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></span> the team has, counting up to 4 stacks of <span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\" class=\"font-bold\"><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></span>.<br>The active Resonator's Echo Skill Crit. Rate is increased by 10%, and their Echo Skill Crit. DMG is increased by 20%.<br>All nearby Resonators in the team gain resistance to interruption.",
